{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Second blocker: completion verification calls an LLM and rebar defaults it to the anthropic provider with no credentials in this environment, the same authentication failure recorded repeatedly on the earlier session log. The review gates avoid it because inv rebar-review-plan sets REBAR_LLM_CONFIG_FILE to config/local/rebar-review.toml, which routes the model classes to bedrock. Nothing sets that for the close gate. Setting the same variable on the transition let completion verification run. That is ADEVX-118, route rebar's LLM gates through the platform tier config, which is open and now has a second call site to cover."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789936232876220001,"uuid":"2d0993b0-359c-4de1-b469-628d4fb42c93"}